From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:52:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] LineageParts: remove the anonymous statistics

LineageParts posts the device name, build, country, carrier and a hash
of the Android ID to stats.lineageos.org once LineageSettings'
stats_collection is on, at the first boot after it is set and every 24
hours. Remove the feature: the lineagestats package (the boot and alarm
receiver, the reporting service, the upload job and the preview
screen), the statistics screen, its part in the catalogue (which is
also what the Settings search index lists) and its entry on the Trust
screen, the endpoint, the proguard keep and the feature's strings in
every locale. LineageParts runs in the system uid, so its manifest
cannot drop its network access; nothing is left that can post.
